Concurrent datatypes
====================

PartialQueueTest.scala: Test of the implementations of a partial queue.

MapTest.scala: Test for Maps.	

ImmutableStack.scala: An immutable stack, used in tests for stacks. 

PartialStackTest.scala: Test for partial stacks.

BoundedPartialStackTest.class: Test for bounded partial stacks.

TotalStackTest.scala: Test for total stacks.

BoundedPartialQueueTest.scala: Test for bounded partial queues.

Synchronisation objects
=======================

BarrierTest.scala: Test of the implementations of a combining barrier.

SyncChanTest.scala: Test of the implementations of a synchronous channel. 

ProducerConsumerTest.scala: Test for the array-based producer-consumer
examples.

MenWomenTest.scala: Test for solutions to the men and women problem.

Locks
=====

DisjointLockTest.scala: Test for disjoint locks.

LockTest.scala: Test for a Lock.

Mod3Test.scala: Test for a mod-3 lock. 

ReadersWritersTest.scala: Test for a readers and writers lock.

